Copy this directory to ./secrets, replace every value and restrict it:

  cp -r secrets.example secrets && chmod 0700 secrets && chmod 0400 secrets/*
  sudo chown -R 10001:10001 secrets        # uid/gid of the "orchestrator" user inside the image

compose mounts each file read-only under /run/secrets/. Credentials files use the my.cnf subset that orchestrator
reads (MySQLTopologyCredentialsConfigFile / MySQLOrchestratorCredentialsConfigFile): a [client] section with
user and password. Quote a password that contains spaces, '#', ';' or quotes.
